nges#{4}":[47,47],"#Intimacy and Preparation for the Oracle#Key Exchanges#{5}":[48,48],"#Intimacy and Preparation for the Oracle#Key Exchanges#{6}":[49,49],"#Intimacy and Preparation for the Oracle#Key Exchanges#{7}":[50,50],"#Intimacy and Preparation for the Oracle#Key Exchanges#{8}":[51,52],"#Intimacy and Preparation for the Oracle#Outcome & Continuity":[53,60],"#Intimacy and Preparation for the Oracle#Outcome & Continuity#{1}":[54,54],"#Intimacy and Preparation for the Oracle#Outcome & Continuity#{2}":[55,55],"#Intimacy and Preparation for the Oracle#Outcome & Continuity#{3}":[56,56],"#Intimacy and Preparation for the Oracle#Outcome & Continuity#{4}":[57,57],"#Intimacy and Preparation for the Oracle#Outcome & Continuity#{5}":[58,58],"#Intimacy and Preparation for the Oracle#Outcome & Continuity#{6}":[59,59],"#Intimacy and Preparation for the Oracle#Outcome & Continuity#{7}":[60,60]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["Charlotte Claymore","Ryan Adame","Florence Claymore","Estra Hamilton","Alec Hamilton","Oracle Ceremony","Marriage Contract","Gold Coin","Sexual Training","Dissociation","Guardianship Provision","Blue Drawing Room"],"position":"after","depth":4,"summary":"This is a lore entry detailing the household's emotional and contractual preparations for their marriage ceremony before the Oracle. Select when referencing the ceremony's immediate lead-up, Charlotte's use of intimacy to assert dominance, the integration of Estra and Alec into the family, or the finalization of the marriage contract. Key relationships involve Charlotte's dominance over Florence and Estra, Ryan's role as an emotional anchor, and the symbolic guardianship contract with Alec. The outcome solidifies the household hierarchy and family bonds."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Flora - Memory Books/Arcs/[ARC 015] - Intimacy and Preparation for the Oracle.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"la